WEBVTT

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:08.710
A-A-Angelica-san is... c-coming to my house?!

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:14.110
Yes... Her birthday the other day passed 
by in a haze before I realized it.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:23.030
Angelica said she wished to see 
the Human World once as well...

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:27.500
I've asked Mother and Father for permission.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.090
Furuichi-dono, is it all right with you?

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.980
Angelica-san is staying over at my house!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.940
<b>Pervert</b>

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.940
<b>Bathwater previously used by Angelica</b>

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:36.140
Plunging in bathwater that Angelica-san used!

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.460
If only a nice girl like 
you would marry Takayuki...

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.690
Oh, stop it, Mother! Whatever are you saying?

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:45.350
Mother, aren't you getting ahead of yourself?

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:46.910
Or wait, could it be?

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:48.110
Etc...!

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:51.270
Furuichi-sama, I can't sleep...

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.840
If you'd like, can we talk?

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.070
Of course! We can talk all night long!

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:57.390
Etc...!

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.050
A wonderful tale begins of two people 
under one roof!

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:03.290
In other words, spring is in the air!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:05.950
Father!

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:07.750
Yes?

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:13.260
I, the humble Furuichi Takayui, 
shall go to await your daughter!

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.800
Angelica-san!

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:17.720
Uh...

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:26.090
She's coming... I know that she'll come!

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:27.650
Just like that day...

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:29.990
Furuichi waited...

00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:33.150
Furuichi waited and waited...

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.650
He continued to wait, forever!

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:39.760
Until Angelica came floating down the river!

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:42.530
I know she'll come!

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.950
Father!

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:54.060
Did you find your way here all right?

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.100
Yes!

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.010
She took the bullet train?!

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:41.990
Called a Magical Girl!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.320
Everyone,

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:48.870
thank you so much for gathering here on the 
occasion of my daughter, Angelica's, birthday.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.250
Angelica! Angelica!

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.250
<b>Welcome Angelica!</b>

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:53.770
Why are you two here?

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:56.670
She's a great woman who helped 
you out! Right, Brother?

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.710
Therefore, as your sworn brother, 
I must also give thanks!

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:01.790
I came 'cause it sounded fun!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:04.350
Thank you for caring all 
the time for my father.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:09.110
I never would have thought Alaindelon-san 
would have had such a grown-up daughter...

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:11.110
And so well-mannered...

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:13.250
On the other hand, our son...

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:14.630
Dad!

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:17.350
Good for you, Taka-chin!

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:19.850
Bein' under the same roof 
as a cutie like that...

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:21.130
Why you little...

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.170
You're such a tease, Misaki-san!

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:27.880
Angelica-san...

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:29.870
Your cuteness blossoms!

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:31.530
Oh, yes!

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:37.280
It's nothing much, but I brought 
gifts for everyone from my homeland!

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:40.050
Now, I'll split my father 
and take the presents out...

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.710
Split your father?

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:45.550
W-Wait a second, Angelica-san!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.180
Yes?

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:50.690
Um, if you're going to 
give presents... Well, uh...

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.650
W-Wouldn't it be more fun 
to make it a surprise?

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:58.080
S-So do it over there, i-in the shed, okay?

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.530
My, I can always count on you, Furuichi-sama!

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:03.050
That <i>is</i> a wonderful idea!

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:05.990
See what I mean, Angelica? 
He's quite a caring fellow.

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:12.980
Oh, right... Angelica-san is oblivious...

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:16.700
But even her obliviousness 
is blooming bright!

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:19.530
What's that?

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.210
W-What happened?

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:27.510
Oh?

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:32.060
That's...

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:33.830
That's definitely...

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.480
...a Yople.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.200
Yopolelippo.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:45.780
I was thinking of taking the presents 
out from my father once I got here...

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.030
So I packed them in the Demon World.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:50.580
And for some reason a Yople popped out.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:53.020
This is bad.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.540
A Yople Alien, of all things...

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.150
Father!

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:01.350
Angelica...

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:03.620
You are safe?

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:08.050
Father, I apologize... Because of me, you...

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.620
What? It's okay.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:14.810
I'm simply glad that you 
were unharmed, my dear.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:15.850
Father...

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:18.310
But I apologize...

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:23.340
It looks like Dad won't be able to accompany 
you on your tour of the Human World.

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.740
Even though it's your birthday and all...

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:29.700
Father, it is fine. I'll come again!

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:32.740
So, please don't worry and 
concentrate on getting well.

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:39.110
We have to find that Yople Alien 
quickly for my father's sake!

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:41.400
Easy to say...

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.130
It's run off.

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:47.940
Um... Brother.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:50.230
If there's anything I can do, just ask.

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:51.680
I'll do anything!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:53.340
Azu'll help, too!

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:55.450
Well, we appreciate the sentiment, but...

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:58.450
This should be nothing for Furuichi the Strategist!

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:02.270
Pararira Pararira Horicouru!

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:04.520
Tokarefu, Chakarefu Patrol!

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.700
Magical Detective Charmy Chaka-chan!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:12.030
Slammer Sausage! Now on sale!

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.510
That!

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:17.940
With that wand I got from you, Father...

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.920
Uh, Angelica...

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:21.370
That's...

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.380
Father rests now.

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:28.480
Oblivious... right?

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:30.030
Wand?

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:35.650
A magic wand that my father 
gave me when I was little.

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:39.730
When I was lonely, or sad, or in trouble...

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:43.270
He said if I waved that wand, 
my wishes would come true!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:48.570
So that's why I always carry it with me!

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.450
Father, now is the time to use it!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.500
U-Uh, wait a minute...

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.680
Isn't that nothing more than...

00:07:56.680 --> 00:08:00.440
Don't you dare, Oga! Don't ruin 
Angelica-san's lovely memories!

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:02.410
Even so...

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:05.760
That's a toy, any way you look at it!

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:08.110
No, it may be more than that.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:14.470
If that is a Demon Sparkling Transformation 
Wand, then it can make people transform.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.350
It can, however...

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:18.180
Here I go, Father!

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:21.230
Yople Piple Pampoppin!

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:23.920
Piple Yople Pampoppin!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:26.310
Piple Yople Pampoppin!

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:40.540
Fairy of Light, Angelica!

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:42.910
In the name of my father...

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.160
...I will punish you!

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:47.580
She actually transformed!

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:53.250
Wait... Was that just...

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:54.430
Super cute!

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:59.140
Your quick outfit change is amazing 
every time I see it, Angelica-san!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:01.240
As expected of the North 
American Quick Change Champion!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:02.510
Isn't that right, Oga?

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:04.390
Huh? Oh... sure.

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:07.650
Brother, that's really not...

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:08.980
She's the champion, damn it!

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.440
Now, Hilda-sama, you too!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.650
Me?

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:17.330
Yes. Without 5 Fairies of Light gathered 
together, we can't display our powers.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:19.020
Now, you too, Hilda-sama!

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:24.060
Y-Yople Piple Pampoppin!

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:26.580
Piple Yople Pampoppin!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.220
Hilda-sama, do the pose!

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:40.350
F-Fairy of Light, Hildegarde!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:45.600
Oh, I forgot! Hilda's the North American 
Quick Change Champion Runner Up!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.730
They're nearly a match for 
each other, right Oga?

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:50.770
Who knew you had such taste...

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.990
Then I'll transform too!

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.100
Trans...form!

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:04.040
Fairy of Light, Fujisaki Azusa!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.450
Ooh, how cute!

00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:09.600
As expected from the North 
American Quick Change Champion!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.050
Only two more...

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:16.330
Now, now, Angelica-san... 
You can't be serious...

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.280
Heck yeah!

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.720
I suppose I must!

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:19.510
They wanna!

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.070
Miracle Transformation!

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:26.480
Fairy of Light, Misaki!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.380
Fairy of Light, Mom!

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.750
I forgot!

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:38.030
You have to be 18 or younger 
to be a Fairy of Light.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.570
Don't act disappointed!

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:44.200
But what'll we do? We need two more...

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.220
Not me! No way!

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:51.360
I'm in middle school now! Why should I 
have to take that kind of punishment?

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:54.790
True...

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:58.000
It's for Angelica-san's sake!

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:02.960
Couldn't you boast in class about how an 
exchange student came to your house?

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:05.680
Angelica-san, did she really come from Macao?

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.470
She's extremely fluent at Japanese...

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:08.970
Macao! Totally Macao!

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:10.670
She was born and raised in Macao,

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:13.780
but she came to Japan to train 
her Quick Change skills.

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:17.990
Look, if you do this for me, 
I'll do whatever you say, okay?

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:20.120
Then...

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.360
What is it?

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:26.380
From now on, don't show 
your face to my friends.

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:29.370
I don't want them finding 
out how icky you are.

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.120
'Kay...

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:35.540
Yople Piple Pampoppin!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.940
Piple Yople Pampoppin!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.590
Fairy of Light, Honoka!

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.140
It's so embarrassing!

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:47.780
What, you want to transform, too?

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.520
Come on! That's impossible...

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.010
It is fine!

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:54.510
Beelze-sama can transform as well! Now!

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:03.560
One more...

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:05.990
I know the perfect person!

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:07.910
Really?!

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:14.180
We're the strongest in 
South Kanto, the Blue Ears!

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:17.730
By South Kanto we mean 
South of the Tone river!

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:22.650
Kunieda Aoi! If we defeat you, 
the 3rd leader of the Red Tails,

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:24.680
The entire Kanto region will belong to us!

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.900
So you're coming at me 
with numbers on your side?

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:31.560
They do say that weak dogs howl a lot...

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.280
Shut up! Get her!

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:37.810
Miss Kunieda!

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:39.700
She looks kinda busy.

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.340
Yople Piple Pampoppin!

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.450
Piple Yople Pampoppin!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.210
W-What the hell?

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:00.160
You think this is a game?!

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:04.220
N-No! I-I don't know what 
just happened either!

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:14.670
What's going on?

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:17.950
I see.

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:22.400
Angelica-san came from Macao, 
and her pet ran away.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:28.180
And in order to catch it, the North American 
Quick Change Champion quick changed me.

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:29.910
So that's how it is.

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.760
R-Right.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:34.160
I so totally don't think she believes us.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.300
Understood. In that case, I 
can understand why you had to.

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:38.420
She believes it?!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:40.640
And my clothes?

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:44.270
U-Um... Until we find the Yople Alien...

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:46.000
You won't give them back?

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.150
Then I have to stay like this?

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:48.930
Yes...

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.430
Serves you right.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:52.680
You're in the same boat.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:56.200
Then let's find this pet right away.

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:01.890
And I'm not doing this for Oga, or because I 
don't want to feel left out, or anything like that!

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:05.320
It's 'cause you look like you need 
help and... because of Macao!

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:07.310
What the hell reason is that?

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:08.950
Thank you very much!

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.270
With that, all 5 are assembled!

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:13.670
Just you wait, Yople Alien!

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:16.710
Fairies of Light, 5!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:33.510
<b>Electronics</b>

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.020
<b>Ishiyama Shopping Street</b>

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.480
<b>Maid Café Saki</b>

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:41.670
<b>Yople</b>

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.230
Here.

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:44.190
Yople!

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:02.730
Why, thank you.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.000
<b>My pleasure.</b>

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.340
Yop?

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.670
Yople!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.870
We haven't found it at all.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.620
I wanna go home...

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:18.600
If my friends see me like 
this, my life is over.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:24.600
It's like... I wish I could use 
magic and stuff with more "bang"!

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:27.440
Don't be silly. It's not like 
you're some magical girl.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.910
But it's really cute when I step!

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:33.320
But that's about it.

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:34.890
Here!

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.580
"God Has Descended on Ishiyama Land".

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.790
"An Incredible Costumed Character Is Here".

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:42.780
Some people just posted these cheeps.

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:44.960
Maybe they're talking about the Yople?

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.730
Ishiyama Land, is it?

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.450
It does seem to be a place 
the Yople would enjoy.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:51.380
Let's go!

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.480
Off we go!

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:55.900
Fairies of Light, 5!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:10.030
Hey, new guy! You're pretty buff.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.690
Yeah! Let's get out there!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.550
Hold it, hold it!

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:20.060
You're here, darn you, Count Poo!

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:22.160
Today of all days I am not 
going to let you get away!

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:26.750
You won't be able to say that for long!

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:27.650
Namul!

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:28.920
Take a look at this!

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:30.990
You're...

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:32.510
Moyashi-kun!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:35.550
That's right! Your friend, Moyashi-kun,

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.800
has joined our side!

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:41.000
Gohan-kun, can you fight your friend?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.270
How dare you play so dirty!

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:47.780
Oh, no! Gohan-kun is in a real pickle!

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:52.740
All you little ones out 
there, save Gohan-kun!

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.950
I need a friend to lend him some power!

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.200
Yople.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.830
Oh! Then that friend, there.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.160
Hurry up and do it!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.580
8 adults...

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:08.380
Right. 8 adults will be 14400.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.970
W-Why me?

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.220
Yople...

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:16.790
Moyashi Namul!

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:17.430
Nam!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:18.680
Go, go!

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:22.840
This is getting out of hand!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:26.900
You wanna ride that, Baby Beel?

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:28.450
Pay attention, would you?

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:35.410
Oga and I on a roller coaster... 
Or in a haunted house...

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:37.240
Or a ferris wheel!

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:44.520
W-Why am I such an idiot?!

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:45.290
Kunieda-senpai!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.290
I'm so embarrassed!

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:51.910
Angelica-san, look!

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:55.480
The Yople Alien!

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:56.220
So it <i>was</i> here!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.210
That's your pet?

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.800
Ooh, how cute!

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.060
We've found you, Yople Alien!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:04.950
The show today is intense!

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:07.050
Dad, who are those people?

00:18:07.050 --> 00:18:08.190
Who knows?

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.650
That can't be Magical Rangers Pretty?

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:11.900
Or wait,

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:14.490
Is that Cutie Bodhisattva 
transformed after their power-up?

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:15.900
Er, no!

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:18.450
To think there are magical girls 
I still haven't heard of...!

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:21.210
Huh? Was this on the schedule today?

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:24.090
Okay, all you good boys and girls!

00:18:24.090 --> 00:18:28.620
We've got a powerful friend to 
help Gohan-kun out of this jam!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:31.250
Give Count Poo a real whooping!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.780
Hold it!

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:37.450
We can't just turn tail and run 
after getting hit like that!

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:40.690
We will take the position of the 
strongest in Kanto no matter what!

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:44.410
So that's why we brought some 
big girls in to help us!

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:46.240
Don't take it personal!

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.310
Somethin' ain't right!

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:53.080
They're big girlies!

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.650
Get 'em!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:55.590
Azusa!

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:00.070
No! That'll be a pain...

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:02.450
Okay, okay!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:10.330
Oga? Oga's come to save me...

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:21.760
Everyone, go for it!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:27.000
Hey! I didn't sign up for this!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.060
You stupid, perverted brother!

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:37.570
Namul...

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:46.080
Good Children Should Not Copy Punch!

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.660
Namul!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:51.930
What the... Isn't that 
Ishiyama's Rampaging Ogre?

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:54.340
And that other guy's pretty nuts too!

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:57.050
Angelica-san!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.130
Furuichi-sama!

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.970
Hurry! Don't worry about me! 
Transfer us together!

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:03.970
But...

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.600
Whatever, just do it!

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:09.350
Understood. Thank you, Furuichi-sama!

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:19.940
Ah... Inside Angelica-san... So warm...

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:29.830
Thank you all for coming today!

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:32.460
What a big mess this became.

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:35.710
It's me.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:37.960
Oh, it's you.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.960
I don't know what happened, but it was fun.

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:42.930
I suppose so.

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:50.680
Oga!

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.060
Huh? Huh?

00:20:58.130 --> 00:21:02.350
So that warm, comfortable, 
slightly cramped space is...

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.070
T-The old man!

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.880
Furuichi-dono you're always so rough...

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.980
But... I like it that way.

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:46.240
Okay Father, until next time.

00:22:46.240 --> 00:22:49.250
Be careful on your way home, Angelica.

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:52.100
Next time, let's go to a lot more places.

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.830
It's okay, Father. It was very fun.

00:22:55.830 --> 00:22:56.850
Thank you.

00:22:58.400 --> 00:22:59.480
Stay well.

00:23:00.150 --> 00:23:03.520
I will. Take care of your health, Father.

00:23:05.020 --> 00:23:08.450
Furuichi-sama, everyone, 
thanks for everything.

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:12.740
And you too, Beelze-sama.

00:23:13.090 --> 00:23:15.380
Furuichi-sama, I leave my 
father in your hands...

00:23:15.780 --> 00:23:20.040
Angelica-san, may I ask 
you one final question?

00:23:20.400 --> 00:23:21.240
Yes?

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:24.330
Um, um...

00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:27.950
Angelica-san, your...

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:29.990
The train is about to depart.

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:33.550
Those people seeing passengers off 
should stay behind the yellow line.

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:35.810
Farewell, everyone!

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:42.350
H-Hey, w-wait!

00:23:42.890 --> 00:23:47.440
Inside of you, Angelica-san... 
W-What happened?

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:05.290
What we've all been waiting for, finally 
it's time for physical examinations!

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:06.920
You think people have been waiting...?

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:08.050
It's only natural!

00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:12.850
And I hear that Kunieda-senpai will be gently 
performing the examination on the boys.

00:24:12.850 --> 00:24:14.890
D-Don't get the wrong idea!

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:17.470
It's just because the class-rep has to help.

00:24:17.850 --> 00:24:19.180
On the next Beelzebub:

00:24:19.420 --> 00:24:21.940
Let's All Get Physicals!

00:24:21.940 --> 00:24:26.530
And with this, Kunieda's well-hidden 
three sizes will finally be revealed!

00:24:26.530 --> 00:24:27.480
Hell no they won't!
